      "blurb": "Cerberus shock trooper with a riot shield and stun baton.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Riot Troopers advance behind heavy ballistic shields, soaking fire to close on entrenched targets and break them with electrified batons. They anchor Cerberus pushes into fortified positions.</p><p><strong>Cerberus Conditioning:</strong> Immune to frightened 1; treats frightened 2+ as frightened 1.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 30 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p><p><strong>Riot Shield:</strong> While the trooper hasn't used an action to Strike since its last turn, it has standard cover (+2 circumstance bonus to AC), already reflected against the first attack each round.</p>",
